{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"8e29b3b3-eb8c-4755-aaec-d317609f4f19":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"link_kKemwR":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/account\/login"}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_W8GwUM":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"6d5b98cf-5085-441e-8662-08829574072f":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"recommended_products_n7Gg6R":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"Discover more moonshines","content":"","button_text":"Add all to cart","product_list":["tough-nut-and-cream-bundle","very-cherry"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"4a60a23d-5b40-45bc-ae40-b73b2e7d52fd":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>With its creamy and delicately sweet flavour, our Macadamia Moonshine is one of the hidden gems of the O'Donnell range.<\/p><p>Perfect for fans of Tough Nut and Sticky Toffee who are looking for something with a more subtle flavour profile or for fans of smooth, vanilla flavours looking to try something totally unique. Enjoy Macadamia neat or as part of a Moonshine cocktail. You can find plenty of drinkspiration on our <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">cocktails page<\/a>.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you would like to discover <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">more high quality liqueurs<\/a>, have a look at our entire product range. Become part of our <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and unlock unique benefits.<\/p><p>For those new to Moonshine, it was the name given to illegally produced grain alcohol distilled during the American Prohibition. It was traditionally bottled in Mason Jars to avoid detection by the authorities. O’Donnell Moonshine retains the rebellious nature of that era, while delivering a whole new world of flavour in our range of smooth and delicious liqueurs.<\/p><h5>*Consult our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/faq\">FAQ's<\/a> for more information.<\/h5>","page":""}},"44cfee33-e315-4dc9-9ddc-8a2b33fde8f1":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"72b15b64-43f1-4772-a7dc-9b35b6e37d23":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<h3>Macadamia Neat<\/h3><ul><li>50ml <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/macadamia?variant=34342093029507\" title=\"Macadamia Moonshine\">Macadamia<\/a><\/li><li>Ice<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><p>Add your Macadamia liqueur to a short glass with ice, enjoy!<\/p><p><\/p><p>You can find more recipes on our <a href=\"\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"Cocktails\">cocktail blog<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"565dec31-7d8c-444b-8572-85cd134959e0":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme - The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"f4a6e323-35ec-4579-9bb2-4f7e96ec8f8b":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products are suitable for those with a gluten intolerance and, unless stated otherwise, are vegan.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"7664d06f-5f5f-491f-b4ed-9372a59e46b6":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","caption","8e29b3b3-eb8c-4755-aaec-d317609f4f19","price","description","variant_picker","quantity_selector","link_kKemwR","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_product_page_W8GwUM","6d5b98cf-5085-